r"""Turn briefings of the Prokhorovka operations, one per 4-hour turn (24 turns, 06:00 10 July - 02:00 14 July 1943),
for both sides in English and Russian; written into the layouts' 'briefing' blocks and their frames rows.

  python tools/prokh_briefs.py            rewrites docs/m11_prokhorovka/layout_10jul.json (turns 1-24),
                                          layout_1011jul.json (1-12) and layout_12jul.json (13-24)

Each text: time, weather (as the layout's frames rows have it), the situation seen from that side, then the task.
Sources: docs/m11_prokhorovka/sources_10jul.md, sources_11_14jul.md, positions_12jul.md (Zamulin, Lawrence).
"""
import json, os

